# Which way is the ground open around V? Ten metres out and back along each
# axis; a direction that is blocked is a warning, not a failure. Read the
# log to pick waypoints for a new spot.
limit 240
needs veh == 0
optional walk ~0 ~10 timeout 15
walk ~0 ~0 within 1.5
optional walk ~10 ~0 timeout 15
walk ~0 ~0 within 1.5
optional walk ~0 ~-10 timeout 15
walk ~0 ~0 within 1.5
optional walk ~-10 ~0 timeout 15
walk ~0 ~0 within 1.5
